    <title>vol.97 - 还没数到三就“睡着”了？！麻醉医生干了啥</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68368dcc38dcc57c64590fcb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68368dcc38dcc57c64590fcb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 04:27:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到第97期协和八啦吧~ 很多病人在手术后回忆自己“被麻倒”的过程，盖上面罩后三秒内就陷入“睡眠”，麻醉真的只是让你睡了一觉吗？在整个手术过程中，麻醉医生到底扮演了怎样的角色呢？为了让大家了解麻醉医生的日常工作，以及麻醉学的一些基础知识，今天我们请到了北京协和医院麻醉科的一一老师跟大家简单介绍一下~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：叔叔 狗狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：北京协和医院麻醉科 一一</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">1:36</a> 麻醉医生的日常工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">5:07</a> 当我七点二十到手术室，发现麻醉老师已经等待多时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">6:40</a> “外科大夫治病，麻醉医生保命”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a> 如同DJ一样的多线工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 麻醉医生坐在那里是在发呆吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 什么人能麻，什么人不能麻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 为啥查房的时候让病人张嘴、仰头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 对抗生素过敏的病人在手术台上CPR</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 手术室中涌入20个麻醉大夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 小下颌、烧伤、口腔癌病人怎么插管</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 手术时间突然延长，麻醉医生需要处理的问题是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 把病人的胳膊从大单下面捞出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 我在缝皮，病人缓缓醒来…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 全身麻醉=静脉麻醉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 局麻手术中，屋里没有麻醉医生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 术中怎么补液？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 开腹手术要计算切口蒸发的水分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> “男的三袋，女的两袋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 要好好轮转麻醉科鸭——</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：Jeff</span></p>]]></description>
